OL,3,AWas Neanderthal life violent? This
OL,4,Awound suggests lethal fighting was more
OL,5,Acommon
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Neanderthal who died 75,000 years ago
OL,8,Fmay have been struck through the chest
OL,9,Fby a sharpened wooden spear,
OL,10,Farchaeologists say.
OL,12,FThey say a 15mm hole found in a
OL,13,Fshoulder blade in a cave in Iraqi
OL,14,FKurdistan could be the earliest
OL,15,Fevidence of lethal violence involving
OL,16,Fsuch a weapon.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
PN,31702
SC,0002
