OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1792090524
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWas Neanderthal life violent? This
OL,4,Awound suggests lethal fighting was more
OL,5,Acommon
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom the angle of the wound and other
OL,8,Fevidence, the researchers believe the
OL,9,Fspear entered the individual's chest
OL,10,Fand passed through the body - probably
OL,11,Fdamaging a lung and major blood vessels
OL,12,F- and exited through the left shoulder
OL,13,Fblade to leave a near-perfect hole.
OL,15,FThe research is the latest in emerging
OL,16,Fevidence that suggests Neanderthal
OL,17,Fsocieties experienced more violence
OL,18,Fthan previously thought.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
